# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FastMRI data and anything derived from it — NEVER commit these.
#
# The raw k-space is held under the NYU FastMRI data use agreement, and that
# covers derived artefacts too, not just the .h5 files. The cohort and cache
# index tables carry coded patient identifiers alongside institution, device_id
# and scanner fields pulled out of the ISMRMRD headers, and the caches
# themselves are reconstructed patient images. pipeline_out/ is therefore
# excluded whole rather than by pattern, so a new subdirectory cannot leak by
# default.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
pipeline_out/
pipeline_out_inventory.log
*.h5
*.tar
data/
results/
results_*/
experiment_output/
checkpoints/
smoke_output/
smoke_results/

# Model checkpoints and weights
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded manuscript drafts.
#
# manuscript/*.docx report numbers that no code in this repository has ever
# produced — see manuscript/DO_NOT_SUBMIT.md, which IS published so the record
# is public. The drafts themselves are kept locally only, because a public copy
# invites someone to read or cite the numbers in them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
manuscript/*.docx
manuscript/figures/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# OS
.DS_Store
._*
